{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52730","headline":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 五 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危，三星不直旧先知。\n危上五黑号人星，人畔三五杵臼形。\n人上七乌号车府，府上天钩九黄晶。\n钩上五鵶字造父，危下四星号坟墓。\n墓下四星斜虚梁，十个天钱梁下黄。\n墓傍两星能盖屋，身着黑衣危下宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}